					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040408,
					"content": "…啊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040409
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040409,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040410,
						80040411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040410,
					"content": "戴因斯雷布？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040412
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80040412,
					"content": "#我也沒料到會在這裡遇上{F#妳}{M#你}們。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040413
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040413,
					"content": "好久不見，戴因…不對，你為什麼會突然出現在層岩巨淵？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040414
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040414,
					"content": "層岩巨淵…這裡是層岩巨淵之下嗎，連我也未曾涉足過的地方…原來是這樣。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040415
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040415,
					"content": "我有很多事情要問你。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040416
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80040416,
					"content": "#那次的「相見」與「分別」都有些倉促，我能理解{F#妳}{M#你}的心情。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040417
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040417,
					"content": "#而從眼前的這份巧合來看，命運確實欠{F#妳}{M#你}一個解答。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040418,
						80040419
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040418,
					"content": "先解釋一下你是怎麼出現在這裡的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040420
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80040420,
					"content": "應該不難猜才對。我之前又捕捉到一名深淵使徒的動向，並開始了追跡。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040421
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040421,
					"content": "只可惜，那傢伙被我逼入絕路後，又玩起了老把戲…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040422
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040422,
					"content": "我緊隨其後穿過了傳送門，果不其然，還是錯誤的地點。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040423,
						80040424
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040423,
					"content": "這麼說來，之前那次你穿過傳送門…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040425
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80040425,
					"content": "嗯，透過近期的一些經歷，我只能推斷…深淵操控著的傳送能力，似乎不只是點對點，而是一個完整的網狀結構。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040426
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040426,
					"content": "傳送門的對面可能是傳送網路中的任何一個節點，這由他們來決定。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040427
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040427,
					"content": "聽起來和傳送錨點也有些相似呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040428
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040428,
					"content": "#總之，儘管那次我緊隨著{F#妳}{M#你}的血親進入了傳送門，可是當我認清四周的時候…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040429
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040429,
					"content": "…卻發現自己已經獨自一人，身處那條風魔龍的巢穴之中。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040430
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040430,
					"content": "喔，說起來，那顆第一台「耕地機」的眼睛怎麼樣了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040431
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040431,
					"content": "我已經安頓好了，在搞清楚那所謂「命運的織機」計畫的真面目之前，無需擔憂它落入深淵之手。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040432,
						80040433
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040432,
					"content": "請你重新自我介紹一下吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040434
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80040434,
					"content": "#哼，{F#妳}{M#你}記住了這個名號嗎。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040435
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040435,
					"content": "並非我有意隱瞞。這個名號曾沐浴著坎瑞亞的榮光，可如今…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040436
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040436,
					"content": "…更像一種諷刺，一種詛咒罷了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040437
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040437,
					"content": "作為見證自己國度覆滅的宮廷衛隊隊長，我想我有理由不願再提起這個名號。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040438
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040438,
					"content": "#看來{F#妳}{M#你}的{F#哥哥}{M#妹妹}說的都是真的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040439,
						80040440
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040439,
					"content": "#關於我{F#哥哥}{M#妹妹}的往事…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040441
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80040441,
					"content": "我們曾是「旅伴」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040442
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040442,
					"content": "那是一段懷抱著苦痛不斷搜尋命運的旅途，只不過…我們未能共同抵達「終點」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040443
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040443,
					"content": "「旅途的終點」…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040444
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80040444,
					"content": "#在{F#妳}{M#你}繼續沒完沒了地發問之前，我有必要提示{F#妳}{M#你}…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040445
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040445,
					"content": "假如我對「傳送網路」的猜測是正確的，剛剛我又恰巧被傳送至此，那就證明在深淵教團眼裡，此處存在著設立傳送節點的價值。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040446
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040446,
					"content": "你是說深淵教團準備在這裡進行什麼行動嗎？這倒是跟我和旅行者的預感一樣。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040447
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040447,
					"content": "那麼，此時此刻的我們…很有可能正在被「深淵」窺伺著。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040448
					],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040448,
					"content": "別、別這麼說，我好像有些毛骨悚然了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040449,
						80040450
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040449,
					"content": "先進行調查吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040451
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80040451,
					"content": "呵，明智。那邊的岩壁附近似乎有火光，我們過去看看。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "戴因斯雷布"
				},
				{
					"id": 80040450,
					"content": "我暫且相信你。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040451
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80040440,
					"content": "你們之間究竟發生過什麼？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040441
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80040433,
					"content": "「末光之劍」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040434
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80040424,
					"content": "#也沒能追上我的{F#哥哥}{M#妹妹}？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040425
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80040419,
					"content": "剛才的傳送門是怎麼回事？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040420
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80040411,
					"content": "真是別樣的出場方式。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80040412
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 800405,
